book record_arrays_matrix
read everything from nil.std.collections

counter begin record
    field total as override integer
end record

array-identity of type T receives items as array of T returns array of T begin paragraph
    give items
end paragraph

main returns override integer begin paragraph
    value original is build counter with total being 3
    value items as array of counter is [original]
    value alias is array-identity of counter with items being items
    value retained is items at 0
    set original.total to 5
    say (items at 0).total
    set (items at 0).total to 7
    say retained.total
    set items at 0 to (build counter with total being 13)
    say (alias at 0).total
    say retained.total
    append original to alias
    say the length of items
    say (items at 1).total

    value empty as array of counter is []
    value independent as array of counter is []
    evaluate empty.reserve with 16
    say the length of empty
    say (empty.capacity with nothing) is at least 16
    append original to empty
    say the length of independent
    say (empty at 0).total

    value filled is new-with-value of counter with size being 3, `value` being original
    set (filled at 0).total to 19
    say (filled at 2).total
    say original.total
    evaluate array-set of counter with arr being filled, idx being 1, `value` being (build counter with total being 23)
    value selected is get of counter with arr being filled, idx being 1
    say selected.total
    say length of counter with arr being filled
    say (items at 1).total
    give 0
end paragraph
